# Local packaging output. dist.pem is the private key that signs a self-hosted .crx --
# committing it lets anyone with repo access sign updates for that extension ID. The Chrome
# Web Store build does not use it at all: you upload a zip of dist/ and Google signs it.
*.pem
*.crx
investor-sidecar-*.zip

